ll,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118949","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118949","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118949.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118949.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-28T14:14:31Z"},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118943\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen we try get blend point name at first time, the `cur_closest` is `-1`. So the assertion will report an error message.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6d6e822c689acb54bf86e19cc2bbbe3fa567b123/scene/animation/animation_blend_space_1d.cpp#L231-L235\r\n\r\nIt won't break the flow, as `get_child_instance_by_path_or_null()` can handle the `null` situation.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6d6e822c689acb54bf86e19cc2bbbe3fa567b123/scene/animation/animation_blend_space_1d.cpp#L559\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nChecking `cur_closest` to consider whether calling `get_blend_point_name()`, then we can prevent the error message.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"